		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Rakshasa noble dressed in the finest garb. A rakshasa who has spent generations studying the secret prayers may become a maharaja.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 50, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 falchion +7 (2d4), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +5, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Impervious</strong>. Only damaged by magical sources. Immune to all hostile spells.</p><p></p><p><strong>Mesmerism</strong>. Can read the minds of all creatures within near. Can instantly take on the illusory appearance of any humanoid.</p><p></p><p><strong>Swift</strong>. ADV on initiative.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
